  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Assimilation Shield Construction</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8d/Yhwach_%28Bleach%29_Blut_Vene_Anhaben.gif/revision/latest?cb=20231001054419\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Yhwach (Bleach) Blut Vene Anhaben\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8d/Yhwach_%28Bleach%29_Blut_Vene_Anhaben.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20231001054419\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8d/Yhwach_%28Bleach%29_Blut_Vene_Anhaben.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20231001054419 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/8d/Yhwach_%28Bleach%29_Blut_Vene_Anhaben.gif/revision/latest?cb=20231001054419 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Yhwach (Bleach) Blut Vene Anhaben\" width=\"270\" height=\"149\" data-image-key=\"Yhwach_%28Bleach%29_Blut_Vene_Anhaben.gif\" data-image-name=\"Yhwach (Bleach) Blut Vene Anhaben.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Yhwach (Bleach) extends Blut Vene to create a force-field that blocks incoming attacks and consumes everything around it, including living beings, in order to maintain itself.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Create a shield that can absorb anything.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>create a shield that can absorb/assimilate anything or anyone</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Force-Field_Generation\" title=\"Force-Field Generation\">Force-Field Generation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Shield_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absorption Shield</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Shield_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user of this power can create a shield that can absorb anything to protect themselves from any incoming attacks and release them later. The user can even absorb people into themselves including allies of the enemy and use them as a hostage to prevent the enemy from attacking them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Shield_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Assimilation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Biological Assimilation\">Biological Assimilation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dimensional_Storage\" title=\"Dimensional Storage\">Dimensional Storage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Assimilation\" title=\"Energy Assimilation\">Energy Assimilation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Force-Field_Generation\" title=\"Force-Field Generation\">Force-Field Generation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fusionism\" title=\"Fusionism\">Fusionism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Reflection\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Reflection\">Power Reflection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Absorption\" title=\"Property Absorption\">Property Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Shield_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Field_Projection\" title=\"Absorption Field Projection\">Absorption Field Projection</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Effect_Field_Projection\" title=\"Effect Field Projection\">Effect Field Projection</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Draining_Field_Projection\" title=\"Draining Field Projection\">Draining Field Projection</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Shield_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May have a limit for what the shield can absorb (matter, energy, fire, etc.)</li>\n<li>May have a limit for how much the shield can absorb at once.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Shield_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Yhwach\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Yhwach\">Yhwach</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li>Naturon Shenron (<i>Dragon Ball GT</i>)</li>\n<li>Super 17 (<i>Dragon Ball GT</i>)</li>\n<li>Rinnegan Users (<i>Naruto</i>); via Gakido/Preta Path\n<ul><li>Madara Uchiha</li>\n<li>Nagato/Pain</li>\n<li>Sasuke Uchiha</li></ul></li>\n<li>Various villains (<i>Sailor Moon</i>)</li>\n<li>Kurumi (<i>Steel Angel Kurumi</i>); via Demon Mode</li>\n<li>Meltlilith (<i>TYPE-MOON</i>)</li>\n<li>Relinquished (<i>Yu-Gi-Oh!</i>)</li>\n<li>Thousand-Eyes Restrict (<i>Yu-Gi-Oh!</i>)</li>\n<li>Stuck Chuck (<i>Kid Cosmic</i>)</li>\n<li>Titans who can use the Vortex Shields (<i>Titanfall</i>)\n<ul><li>Ions</li>\n<li>Vanguards; via the Expedition loadout</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssimilation_Shield_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"4d4aa26c5f6f384f0fa61163463da3b2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:142px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Super_17_Absorption_Barrier-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:140px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Super_17_Absorption_Barrier.png\" title=\"Super 17 Absorption Barrier.png (433 KB)\" style=\"height:140px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/14/Super_17_Absorption_Barrier.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20140418051839\" title=\"Super 17 Absorption Barrier.png (433 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Super 17 (Dragon Ball GT) has an energy absorption barrier installed in him, absorbing energy attacks to increase his own strength, even the 10x Kamehameha.\" height=\"140\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Super 17 Absorption Barrier.png\" data-image-key=\"Super_17_Absorption_Barrier.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Super 17 (Dragon Ball GT) has an energy absorption barrier installed in him, absorbing energy attacks to increase his own strength, even the 10x Kamehameha.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Super 17 Absorption Barrier.png (433 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Super 17 (Dragon Ball GT) has an energy absorption barrier installed in him, absorbing energy attacks to increase his own strength, even the 10x Kamehameha.\" height=\"140\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Super 17 Absorption Barrier.png\" data-image-key=\"Super_17_Absorption_Barrier.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Super 17 (Dragon Ball GT) has an energy absorption barrier installed in him, absorbing energy attacks to increase his own strength, even the 10x Kamehameha.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/14/Super_17_Absorption_Barrier.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20140418051839\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Super 17 (Dragon Ball GT) has an energy absorption barrier installed in him, absorbing energy attacks to increase his own strength, even the 10x Kamehameha.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:142px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Naruto_Pain_Preta_Path_Blocking_Technique_Absorption_Seal-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px; top:18px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Naruto_Pain_Preta_Path_Blocking_Technique_Absorption_Seal.gif\" title=\"Naruto Pain Preta Path Blocking Technique Absorption Seal.gif (1.99 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/Naruto_Pain_Preta_Path_Blocking_Technique_Absorption_Seal.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20201121020612\" title=\"Naruto Pain Preta Path Blocking Technique Absorption Seal.gif (1.99 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"The Preta Path of Pain (Naruto) generating a barrier that absorbs all ninjutsu.\" height=\"140\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Naruto Pain Preta Path Blocking Technique Absorption Seal.gif\" data-image-key=\"Naruto_Pain_Preta_Path_Blocking_Technique_Absorption_Seal.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The Preta Path of Pain (Naruto) generating a barrier that absorbs all ninjutsu.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Naruto Pain Preta Path Blocking Technique Absorption Seal.gif (1.99 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"The Preta Path of Pain (Naruto) generating a barrier that absorbs all ninjutsu.\" height=\"140\" width=